Disaster Recovery Coordinator
Copyright 2026 Summon Software Labs

This product includes software developed for the Disaster Recovery Coordinator
project (https://github.com/summonlabs/Disaster-Recovery-Coordinator).

The Disaster Recovery Coordinator implementation, its public API surface, its
command line tools, its durable journal and snapshot formats, and the synthetic
effect endpoints used by its test suites were all written for this repository.
No third-party runtime dependency is vendored, linked, or required: the
SHA-256 and CRC-32C implementations, the canonical encoders, the strict record
decoder, the journal/snapshot formats, the loopback transport, and the
subprocess launcher are part of this distribution.

The synthetic effect endpoints model the externally observable behaviour of a
site control plane, a placement/reservation/capacity authority, an accelerator
execution recovery authority, and a network recovery authority. They do not
talk to, and are not derived from, any real data centre management, building
management, orchestration, or infrastructure product.
